\newlabel{fig:bhdforligochapterbeamshapesa}{{1.9}{29}{Top panel: the beam profile for the alternative layout of HAM6 suggested in Section \ref {sec:BHDforligochapter_super_actuator}. Bottom panel: The Gouy phase accumulated along the optical axis for the alternative layout. While alignment Gouy phase is degraded, the mode-matching Gouy phase was changed to bias the optical layout for correcting errors in the RoC of SR3.\relax }{figure.caption.38}{}}
